{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id22607887"}, "name":{"label":"Harmony808"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-12T13:39:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"14542441571"}, "title":{"label":"Long time semi-reliable app broken"}, "content":{"label":"It apparently was updated within the past day and that update appears to a broken it. When I change the text on a Sticky Widget it will not stay even after I click them but reverts to the prior note. At some point, hours later, the edited note will appear, but that’s no good to me later\n\nNow, this morning, I can’t keep a note open to even edit a note, because as soon as I open it, it snaps shut. I even tried restarting the phone (I am running the latest iOS). The app is now essentially worthless to me. Too bad, because when it’s working and it’s reliable it is worth it.\n\nI don’t like to put support complaints into the review, but when I went to the app support button all it took me to was the developers list of apps with no way to contact him about this one. Anyway, be warned.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
