{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id22230569"}, "name":{"label":"Sagerchatter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-31T13:49:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"14495283036"}, "title":{"label":"Updated or maybe not?"}, "content":{"label":"This app is handy and for the most part I’m happy with it. However the widget does not show the text, which basically negates its usefulness for me. FWIW, it does show up if I pin it to my lock screen, but I don’t want it that visible. To their credit, today’s update to the app said they track this down. Hopefully it will be easy to find for when it actually…sticks. (Har har)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
