{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id269209504"}, "name":{"label":"Alders88"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-05T00:30:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"14145816319"}, "title":{"label":"I use it a lot but…it’s broken."}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried to get help on this issue by directly reaching out but haven’t heard anything back in months so, this is my last resort. \n\nI think overall that the app is better than one star and I’ll gladly update my review once they fix some of the issues. \n\nThe biggest one is that when you make a note into a checklist, you can no longer open the note or edit it beyond checking things off. I have a note that I have now effectively lost because I can’t see the note beyond the preview. \n\nAnother issue is that you sometimes lose info if you leave the app to do something like check text if you didn’t save the note because the app may refresh when you return. \n\nLastly, a few small things that I wish would be updated. 1) No longer being forced to name notes. 2) being able to hide the keyboard so you can view a note in full screen. 3) bullet points!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id74025875"}, "name":{"label":"chuisu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-01T11:46:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"14132273161"}, "title":{"label":"Bugs, bugs"}, "content":{"label":"pretty buggy app. On the pro version, deleting a listed item and then pressing \"Close\" causes another empty listed item to appear (repeatable), currently, adding a new note to a lockscreen widget slot 2 doesn't work, saying that slot is empty when added to the lockscreen. Homescreen seems to work okay.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id41415373"}, "name":{"label":"ALM293"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-30T10:55:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"14124284227"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastically Functional!"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app! I’m neurodivergent (or NeuroSparkly, whichever term you prefer) and often find myself distracted. Sticky Widgets is a simple app that allows me to pin notes in such a way that I can see what my goals are for the next few hours which helps me get more done and forget fewer tasks. It also has fantastic customization options with a lovely - and quite straightforward - user interface.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
