{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id301643605"}, "name":{"label":"Pin it so it stays pinned"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-26T08:59:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"14108626156"}, "title":{"label":"Pin it"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t like that once I in my note to my home/lock screen it doesn’t stay.  It unpins automatically and i need it to stay. It should have option to unpin it when you want to unpin it. Can you change that? Otherwise I love it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id105516010"}, "name":{"label":"DiaCora_di_fi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-25T17:13:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"14106256244"}, "title":{"label":"Does what I need very well"}, "content":{"label":"I keep 5-6 sticky notes on my screen for daily journaling and goal check ins. Every day I change the color of the notes. I enjoy creatively picking gradients as part of my journaling routine. I have a gratitude note, notes for a quarterly goal, a monthly goal, a daily intention (around an aspirational character trait), and 1-2 others. I track progress to my goals, give myself kudos, and note my biggest obstacles at the moment. It works really well for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
